) An explosion near a bus station in Gombe, Nigeria, killed at least five people and injured over a dozen, with witnesses describing a woman placing an explosives-laden bag near a bus before detoning it, setting the bus on fire.  
) Although no group has claimed responsibility, Boko Haram is the main suspect, as the group has a history of targeting bus stations and markets, especially amid recent setbacks from regional offensives.  
